From 497a01772b06f36130b5a7f57f2f0cc0b963edf5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Augustin Cavalier <waddlesplash@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 28 Jul 2026 13:11:55 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] kernel: Various checks for memcpy()s into the physical map
 region.

 * raw memcpy() should never write to kernel physical map area directly
 * check state of pages being written to
 * check that page table pages aren't written to (or otherwise ACCESS'ed
   outside of page table routines)
---
